  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 809.09 Epichlorohydrin",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 809.09 Epichlorohydrin. For epichlorohydrin violations, the statement shall read as follows:\n\n“Some people who drink water containing high levels of epichlorohydrin over a long period of time could experience stomach problems, and may have an increased risk of getting cancer.”\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Dw 800) #9730, eff 6-30-10; ss by #12675, eff 1-1-19",
